<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1100s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 12th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1100s BCE, 72 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 25 were founded and 25 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the Egyptian Empire New Kingdom and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
